{
    "title": "Blade Night : Rhythm Saber",
    "description": "Full mod characters! The most fashionable hip-hop style & popular Y2K music! Combination of the epic music game and classic music race gameplay! <b>All in the whole new 3d music race game!</b>Ready to beat all Indie enemies in rhythm mod!\r\n\r\nIn Blade Night game, you will play as a Boyfriend who is invited to a fun but freaky party. On the way to the party, dangers are waiting for you. Dare you to explore and protect your Girlfriend from danger?\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640<b>Dash forward with your lightsaber in hand!\r\nWill you defeat all indie enemies, or fail miserably?</b>\r\n\r\n\u2694\ufe0f<b>How to Defeat All Mods</b>\u2694\ufe0f\r\nHit the colored arrows, and avoid the black flame arrows. Y2K Pop just came off your fingertip.\r\nGet the combos to get the highest score point and beat enemies. Enjoy Friday Night party!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6<b>Feature of Blade Night</b>\ud83c\udfb6\r\nCover full 3D mod characters & all songs\r\nThrowback music and sound effects\r\nCyberpunk style and amazing runway\r\nVarious thrilling levels with different challenge mods\r\nAll game mod test your agility\r\n\r\nFight with BF Crew in Music beat, dance with cg5, indie cross and rhythm!\r\nWant to be a true hero of GF? <b>DOWNLAND Blade 3D GAME FOR FREE NOW and beat them all! </b>Let the Blade Night go drive you insane!",
